SYNTHETIC CONTENT NOTICE
------------------------
Every section-4.8 document in this dataset is FICTIONAL: it was written
by a large language model and does not correspond to any officially
published drug fact sheet. The documents must not be used as a source
of clinical, pharmacological or regulatory information about any real
medicine. What comes from the real world is only the underlying set of
canonical annotations — the (adverse reaction, frequency, organ system,
active ingredient) tuples extracted from the AEMPS-CIMA fact sheets that
seeded the generation.

ATTRIBUTION
-----------
The canonical annotations behind the generated text derive from the
Spanish drug fact sheets (fichas técnicas / Summary of Product
Characteristics, SmPC) published by the Spanish Agency for Medicines and
Medical Devices (Agencia Española de Medicamentos y Productos
Sanitarios, AEMPS) through the CIMA portal (https://cima.aemps.es/).
When redistributing or building upon this dataset, please attribute
both:

  1. Guerrero Guirado, L. M. (2026). CIMA Sección 4.8 ADR NER Extended
     (corpus sintético de reacciones adversas). UNED PFG.
     https://huggingface.co/datasets/guerrerotook/CIMA-4.8-ADR-NER-EXTENDED
  2. AEMPS — Centro de Información Online de Medicamentos (CIMA).
     https://cima.aemps.es/
